 <headline>Heavy Rain Warning</headline>
 <description>
Periods of northerly rain expected to ease early this afternoon. During this period a
further 20 to 30 mm is expected to accumulate about the eastern areas and lesser amoun
ts elsewhere. Peak intensities of 10 to 20mm/hr in isolated heavy falls.
 </description>
 <instruction>
Note: A Severe Weather Warning or Watch means conditions are favourable for severe wea
ther in and close to the indicated area. People in these areas should be on the lookou
t for threatening weather conditions and monitor for further updates from MetService.
For information on preparing for and keeping safe during a storm, see the Civil
Defence Get Ready Get Thru website.
 </instruction>
